  "title": "[FULL] A 5-Year-Old Mermaid Swam Ashore to Find Her Billionaire Daddy!",
  "description": "Synopsis:<br><br>Five years ago, Serafina, a brilliant jewelry designer, was heartlessly turned away by the powerful billionaire Jasper Voss when she came to tell him she was pregnant. Heartbroken, she retreated to the ocean to raise their daughter alone. But little Mia, an adorable mermaid tot, refuses to give up on having a family. She swims ashore, scales the walls of Jasper&apos;s private island, and crashes into his life, boldly claiming the cold CEO as her &quot;Daddy!&quot;<br><br>Shocked by the girl who shares his striking ice-blue eyes, Jasper demands a DNA test. When the results reveal a 99.99% match, Jasper is overjoyed—but Serafina is furious, believing he abandoned them both five years ago. As Jasper desperately tries to win back the woman he never stopped loving and become the father Mia deserves, they uncover a terrifying conspiracy.<br><br>Someone in Jasper&apos;s inner circle orchestrated the entire misunderstanding, sending a fake secretary to intercept Serafina and forge a cruel rejection letter. The mastermind? The sinister Colleen Thorn, who will stop at nothing to force Jasper to marry her own daughter. With their family finally reunited, Jasper and Serafina must team up to destroy the Thorn empire and protect their little mermaid. Will true love conquer years of deceit, and will they finally get their happily-ever-after? Watch this heartwarming, fantasy-filled billionaire romance to find out!<br><br>⚠️ Viewer Advisory :<br>This video is a fictional contemporary fantasy romance and family drama featuring themes of secret babies, corporate conspiracies, and mermaid lore. All characters, storylines, and events depicted are completely fictional. Viewers are advised to enjoy the story responsibly.<br><br>🔥 <b>*Love secret baby tropes, groveling CEOs, sweet mermaid fantasy, and satisfying karma? Don&apos;t forget to Like, Share, and Subscribe to stay updated on our latest cinematic series!*</b><br><br><br><a href=\"https://www.yout